  the scroll of the true age (age)
  A ninja knows when he was forged, and says so when asked.

    cmd/gate/main.go:10  This main declares no build and built, so game cannot stamp it, and does not answer --age.

  Declare build and built, the stamp game passes, and make the main a
  pzm tool, which answers --age with them, so anyone can ask a binary
  which commit it is.

